            "sid": "NEH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa söpïchtö anka nyay akusoyönisïyi. Kuwit okumpö löt arïpan chane nko kareranpa pich. Kïrïp nayat kutang Pchöri Nököghon, kïparta Nayatunay Tapes ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akutang Kuka Epraim nko Kuka Köny nko Kuka Kaghagh akïnam Pchöri Ananel nko Pchöri Pokol akïlït Kuka Kechir atolapay kïpka kughyongö Kuka Ripï.",
          "type": "text",
