          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikikïl pich asisoni cho kiripöy töpoton cho kimi wölo kikïrorchini pasan nko akwa cho le poretay nko kareranpa taman akïghamït chane tïkwïn cho pkono paren cho mi kanastin lenyini kimwoghöy kirurut lö pöyitu tïsï nko pipö Lawi, ompöwölo kingörekyï Yuda tïsï nko pipö Lawi cho kipöghisyechini chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
